        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebyo mutabisinzanga, kuba nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe ndi wa nkikidi ku bantu bange. Abo abankyagha mbabonereza, era naabonereza n'abaana baibwe, n'abaidhukulu, okutuukira irala ku luse olwokusatu n'olwokuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
