        {
          "text": "Aye olunaku olwomusanvu, lwa Sabbato yange nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Olwo mutalukolerangaku mulimo gwonagwona waire imwe beene, waire batabane baimwe, waire baghala baimwe, waire abairu baimwe abasaadha oba abakazi, waire ensolo dhaimwe, era waire abasenze be musuza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
