          "text": "kuba mu nnaku omukaaga nze Musengwa Katonda nakola eigulu, n'ensi, n'enhandha n'ebirimu byonabyona, naawuumula ku lunaku olwomusanvu. Kye nava ni ndugha enkabi era ni ndutukuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
