              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muteegwanizanga ndhu dha bantu bandi. Muteegwanizanga baka beene, waire okwegwaniza abairu baibwe abasaadha oba abakazi, waire ente dhaibwe, oba endogoyi dhaibwe, oba ebintu byaibwe ebindi byonabyona.”",
          "type": "text",
